      "Outside of work, I spend a lot of time cycling and hanging out with Finn, my westie - who has strong opinions about walk schedules and absolutely none about motion design. I care deeply about craft, consistency, and pragmatism, and I believe great motion should feel invisible: intentional, purposeful, and grounded in real user needs.\n"
