    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "Lotties Library and Production at Scale",
      "company": "Qonto",
      "color": "#141414",
      "passwordProtected": false,
      "password": "spiros2026",
      "customUrl": "",
      "bodyText": "",
      "cardPreview": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dnbmyyc9x/image/upload/v1769886597/portfolio/cover-lotties_zunbzo.gif",
      "media": {
        "hero": "lottie-library-cover.html",
        "grid": []
      },
      "bodyHtml": "<!-- Project 3: Lotties Library and Production at Scale – same project style (styles-figma.css) -->\n<style>\n    #projectModalBody .lottie-container {\n        width: 100%;\n        aspect-ratio: 1;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        background: #000000;\n    }\n    #projectModalBody .lottie-container lottie-player { width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n    #projectModalBody .lottie-card {\n        background: #000000;\n        border-color: #222;\n    }\n    #projectModalBody .stats-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n        gap: 10px;\n        margin: 10px 0;\n    }\n    #projectModalBody .stat-card {\n        padding: 24px;\n        text-align: center;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        #projectModalBody .lottie-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; }\n        #projectModalBody .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"motion-system-content\">\n    <!-- Tags -->\n    <div class=\"motion-tags\">\n        <span class=\"motion-tag\">Animation Production</span>\n        <span class=\"motion-tag\">Lottie</span>\n        <span class=\"motion-tag\">Technical Pipeline</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Intro -->\n    <p class=\"motion-intro\">\n        I <strong>led the management of a 1,000+ Lottie animation library</strong> at Qonto—producing animations, leading the JSON → .lottie migration, and managing the technical pipeline across teams.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"motion-meta\">2022 - 2026 Staff Motion Designer, Design System</div>\n\n    <!-- TLDR -->\n    <div class=\"motion-section motion-tldr-box\">\n        <div class=\"motion-section-label\">TLDR</div>\n        <h2 class=\"motion-section-title\">1,000+ Lottie library. JSON → .lottie migration. Technical owner.</h2>\n        <div class=\"motion-section-content\">\n            <p>Managed 1,000+ Lottie library across product, website, marketing. Produced animations, led 6-month JSON → .lottie migration, and became technical owner for format guidelines and cross-platform compatibility.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Stats -->\n    <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">1,000+</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Lottie Files</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">3</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Platforms</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">JSON → .lottie</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Format Migration</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Production & Pipeline -->\n    <div class=\"motion-section\">\n        <div class=\"motion-section-label\">Production</div>\n        <h2 class=\"motion-section-title\">Managing at Scale</h2>\n        <div class=\"motion-section-content\">\n            <p>\n                I <strong>managed a 1,000+ Lottie animation library</strong> across Qonto's product, website, and marketing. Produced animations alongside other motion designers, optimized for performance, and ensured consistency across platforms.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n                Built the pipeline: LottieFiles library structure, export standards, and led <strong>JSON → .lottie migration</strong> with engineers over 6 months—reducing file sizes, improving Android performance. Became technical owner for format guidelines and cross-platform troubleshooting.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Documentation & standards (Lottie Center) -->\n    <div class=\"motion-section\">\n        <div class=\"motion-section-label\">Documentation</div>\n        <h2 class=\"motion-section-title\">Lottie Center</h2>\n        <div class=\"motion-section-content\">\n            <p>\n                <strong>Lottie Center</strong> is the internal hub I created so designers and stakeholders have one place for standards and how‑to’s: step-by-step guides (create, export, naming, delivery), technical specs, and handoff paths for in-app vs website.\n            </p>\n            <p><strong>Standards I documented:</strong></p>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0.5em 0 1em 1.2em;padding:0;list-style:disc;\">\n                <li><strong>Size:</strong> up to 500kb</li>\n                <li><strong>Frame rate:</strong> 25fps or 30fps</li>\n                <li><strong>Format:</strong> .json for web, .lottie for Android, iOS and Web</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>\n                Documented flows: create & export, naming (in-app vs website), delivery to product and web, LottieFiles workflow, and sharing with internal and external partners.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Library -->\n    <div class=\"motion-section\">\n        <div class=\"motion-section-label\">Library</div>\n        <h2 class=\"motion-section-title\">Selected Work</h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"lottie-grid\">\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-1.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-2.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-3.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-4.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-5.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-6.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-7.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-8.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lottie-card\">\n                <div class=\"lottie-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n                    <video src=\"lottie-9.webm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;\"></video>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Impact -->\n    <div class=\"motion-section\">\n        <div class=\"motion-section-label\">Impact</div>\n        <h2 class=\"motion-section-title\">Beyond Individual Files</h2>\n        <div class=\"motion-section-content\">\n            <p>\n                The library became a shared production asset across teams. Engineers integrated confidently. Designers referenced existing work. The .lottie migration improved Android performance across the entire product.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// Lottie hover interaction (iframes autoplay, so we just update opacity for focus effect)\nfunction focusLottie(index) {\n    // Dim all others\n    for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n        const card = document.querySelectorAll('.lottie-card')[i];\n        if (card) {\n            if (i !== index) {\n                card.style.opacity = '0.3';\n            } else {\n                card.style.opacity = '1';\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction unfocusLottie() {\n    // Reset all to full opacity\n    document.querySelectorAll('.lottie-card').forEach(card => {\n        card.style.opacity = '1';\n    });\n}\n</script>\n"
    },
